WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:04.330
Near the end of the Eastern Han dynasty,

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.540
Duchang was besieged by
the remnants of the Yellow Turbans

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.420
and was under heavy attack.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.790
Thereupon, the future Wu general Taishi Ci

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.250
dared to venture outside the fortress and
practice his archery for several days,

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.000
thereby attracting the attention of the
Yellow Turban remnants.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.330
When the enemy eventually let their guard down,

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.750
he charged ahead alone on horseback,
immediately breaking out of the siege.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.920
This is known as the stratagem of
"creating something from nothing."

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:34.330
Stratagem:

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:34.330
Create something

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:34.330
from nothing

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.380
He showed something without substance,
tricked the enemy,

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.380
and then employed the substance to launch an attack.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.170
That is one of the Thirty-Six Stratagems.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.290
Now, back to the present.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.710
Zhuge Kongming, a genius tactician who has
been reincarnated in modern-day Japan,

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.540
decided that his master Eiko's next performance
would be at a festival in Yoyogi.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
However, she was assigned a stage
in an out-of-the-way spot.

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:50.540
I think we'll just take it nice and easy today.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.290
Pitted against a popular band playing
at the stage next to hers,

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:55.380
she had her back against the wall.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:59.790
But even so, Kongming had the situation
in the palm of his hand.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.750
It's party time.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:07.620
Kongming brilliantly provided Eiko

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.620
with joyous cheers and a boost in confidence,

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:11.750
and he sublimated his own regret

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:11.750
into the far ends of time.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.120
And then...

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.790
It would seem the one we're really after
has been caught in our net.

