Kongming Lights the Way

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.920
Kongming, who is that?

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.080
Mr. Tsuyoshi Kondo.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.920
He is this festival's organizer

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:04.460
and a producer who manages major festivals
both in and outside Japan.

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:07.170
He's the most influential person
in the music festival world.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.620
To think someone like that would
come to a tucked-away stage...

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.750
He's not here about a complaint

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:14.750
due to the lights we put up, is he?

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.710
Thank you for coming out all this way.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.420
Would you care for a drink?

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:24.460
Kongming! Don't trouble our guests!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.120
EIKO...

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:29.920
Amazing!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:35.000
It was your first appearance and yet never before
has anyone drawn such a crowd to Stage E-15.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.210
Magnificent!

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.750
You're also cute as can be.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:39.790
That's what he said.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:40.880
Huh?

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:44.380
We also see your performance was
a big hit on social media.

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.540
Huge crowd at E15 #AFL #ArtFesLive #E15

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.540
Murata

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.540
I take part every year, but this sets a new record!

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.540
For an unpopular stage, it's a miracle.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.500
"Huge crowd at E15."

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.960
"I take part every year, but this sets a new record!"

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.040
"For an unpopular stage, it's a miracle."

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.460
"She's got herself a new fan."

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.960
"EIKO's singing is so gooood."

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.120
So on and so forth.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.500
On the whole, it seems you were a hit.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.380
And so...

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.380
I want EIKO to perform at another one of my festivals...

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.620
He says.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:05.830
WHAT?!

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:08.040
Appearing at the Art Fes,

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.290
snatching Jet Jacket's audience,

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:13.080
giving Eiko a boost in confidence
with a big success off home turf...

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:17.540
And beyond that, catching Kondo's eye and
laying the groundwork for her next performance...

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.670
He really is something special, after all!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:22.620
Okay...

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.620
All right...

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:25.210
There is still a slot open.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.620
Okay!

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:30.080
EIKO, I feel you have great talent.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.960
We would like to prepare a special stage
for you to perform on.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.710
That's what he said.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.500
My gosh, for little ol' me?

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.040
Before you are two business cards.

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:54.420
This one is for the man in charge of a music festival
that will be held a month from now in Fukuoka.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.380
It's on the same scale as today's event
with about 10,000 attendees.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.880
The other is for the head of booking
for a major summer festival

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.750
that attracted over 300,000 attendees last year:

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.920
Summer Sonia.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.830
Please take the card for the event
you'd like to perform at.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:13.880
Summer Sonia is one of the largest
music festivals in all of Japan...

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.040
Eiko performing on the same stage as top-class artists?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.420
Simply amazing!

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.380
Are you sure you're okay with little ol' me performing?

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:32.080
But if you will have me,
I'd like to go with Summer Sonia...

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:36.120
However...

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:42.750
A condition for Summer Sonia is participating in the
"100,000 Likes for the Right to Appear" project.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:47.210
It's a project we put together for artists
we see as showing promise.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:50.170
If you're able to secure 100,000 likes
within the time frame,

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:52.670
you'll be given a slot to perform at Summer Sonia.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.580
I've heard of this project before...

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:59.460
A group that broke up after not
garnering enough likes...

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:04.170
...making a killing with an

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:04.170
excessively sexy stream

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:04.170
I didn't wanna see you like this

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:04.170
You should just call it quits!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:03.750
An idol who went too far in trying to go viral for likes
and disappeared from public view...

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.250
It's a double-edged sword

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:09.500
where you get put in the spotlight
but end up losing it all if you fail.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:14.790
I should mention that in the project's five years
only a single group has succeeded.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:18.580
Well, the best little ol' me has done...

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.120
is getting around 1,400 likes.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.330
One hundred thousand is downright impossible.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.330
The festival in Fukuoka is the way to go, isn't it?

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:30.710
Right, Kongming?

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:34.500
Eiko, I will...

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:38.620
do everything in my power
to help you realize your dream.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.040
No matter how difficult the road may be.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.920
Eiko, what is your dream?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.210
To debut as a professional singer?

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.750
To gather an audience 10,000 strong?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.540
Eiko, think about this carefully!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.380
This "100,000 Likes Project" is too damn risky!

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.620
My dream...

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.620
It's like charging a vast army all on your own! Don't do it!

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:58.750
is to perform at the world's largest music festival,

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:58.750
It's like charging a vast army all on your own! Don't do it!

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.670
Voicell Land.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:02.580
Eiko! Eiko!

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.330
Go with the Fukuoka festival. Got it?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.120
That one, that one there!

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.710
Which means...

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.710
I can't just take the easy road!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:20.120
Summer Sonia or bust!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.460
This is the correct choice, right, Kongming?

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.750
Bravo!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.620
I have a crush on EIKO.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:38.670
Th-thank you!

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:40.080
What did he say?

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.000
"I have a crush on"

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.380
is slang that means "I am very charmed by."

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:49.040
Well then, I'll get in touch with the relevant parties.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:53.750
I look forward to seeing you over at
Summer Sonia, EIKO.

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:59.670
So the guy CAN speak Japanese normally.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.290
Sommer Sonia...

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.580
For real?

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.620
Now that you've chosen, I'll do all I can to support you,

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.460
but how are we gonna get you 100,000 likes?

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:14.750
It will be all right!

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.000
Surely Kongming will be able to
come up with something.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.380
Right, Kongming?

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.710
That could prove rather tough.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.000
Hey now!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.290
NOOO!

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.790
You were supposed to say that
you'd find a way to do it!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.960
What was that talk about my dreams?!

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.170
It's all over!

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.290
My dreams are dashed!
H-hey...

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:37.000
What I mean is, it is tough as things currently stand.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.290
There is something I've had in mind
for a long time now.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.000
"When the heavens and time are suitable
but man is lacking,

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.210
one is running counter to man."

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.960
In other words, at the current time,
we require new human resources.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.170
Human resources?

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.380
That's right.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.000
Someone with spirited vibes.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.250
Vibes, you say?

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.420
One whose flow makes fools of our foes...

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.620
Flow?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:10.170
We shall add a mighty rapper to our team!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.250
But why a rapper?

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:15.120
ya

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.540
Ya Boy Kongming!

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:15.670
ya Boy

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:15.880
ya Boy KONG

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.000
ya Boy KONGMING!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.500
One hundred eighty five...

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:22.120
Two hundred thirty...

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:23.880
One hundred sixty three...

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:25.960
Three hundred fifty eight...

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.540
Five hundred fifty seven...

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.750
Forty five...

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.120
Forty five?!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.170
What the hell's this?

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.460
Why'd I even post it?

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:37.830
I guess 1,400 is my most likes, after all.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.500
Hey...

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.040
Owner?! You look exhausted.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.960
Well, I was racking my brain about the 100,000 likes.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:46.830
I couldn't get a wink of sleep.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:49.040
Same here.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.420
One hundred thousand...

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.170
Yikes! It's terrifying!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.330
One hundred thousand is terrifying!

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.460
Eiko, just calm down!

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:57.920
I've gotta do something, and quick!

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.790
If I don't take action,
I'll be crushed under the weight of this 100,000!

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.960
I'm sure that Kongming is thinking up a plan!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.210
But I don't have any idea what he's thinking, you know?!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.540
Crap! There's no denying that!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.580
This 100,000 thing's scary!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.000
Hiya.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.210
What's wrong, Eiko?

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.880
One hundred thousand likes...

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:15.880
What do you mean?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:16.960
It'll be okay.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.880
Let's get Kongming and see what he has to say. 'Kay?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.710
Kongming? He's out right now.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:21.670
What?!

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:23.500
He was talking to someone outside.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:26.460
Wearin' that again today, Kongming?

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.670
You're so funny!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:30.120
How many of that same outfit you got?
Damn, dude!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.380
Hold on, let's take a selfie.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:34.080
How sweet is that?
I'm thinkin' we gotta hit an a.m. bash.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.750
Yes, a morning party, correct?

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.380
They go hard there!

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.790
It's one of those party till you drop deals.

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:40.580
You should totally down a Monster, bro!

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.120
Damn, I'm pumped!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.790
Let's take a selfie with different poses.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:45.000
Kongming, yay!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.040
He made plans to go out and party.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.000
How can he party at a time like this? Jeez!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.580
Aw man, no one did any prep.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.330
We're opening soon, you know.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.040
Eiko, nothin' we can do right now.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:57.040
Let's switch gears.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.380
All right.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.290
Hittin' the morning party again?

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.210
Yeah, for sure!

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:12.170
Right?!

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.120
I'll see you there again!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.170
Hard at it, I see.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:25.080
I have finished cleaning my floor,
so I'll be taking my leave now.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.040
See you!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.120
Kongming! You have a minute?

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:34.170
My apologies, but I've made plans

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:34.170
to meet up with someone.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.460
Right after this?
At four in the morning?

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.250
I ask that you please excuse me for today.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.120
Yo! Kongming!

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.500
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.210
Damn, you look dope in the a.m.!

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:50.170
I'll finish up here, so you can head on home.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.080
I'm gonna clean a bit more first!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.290
Pretty angry, huh?

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:00.620
Jeez! What's his deal?!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.500
The 100,000 Likes Project is under way!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.500
What is the 100,000 Likes Project?

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.460
For now, I've gotta do what I can!

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:43.040
Kongming!

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.620
Kongming?

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.460
That's strange...

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:48.920
I heard he was renting a room at the club.

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:52.460
Keep Closed

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.750
Kongming?!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.000
Oh, Eiko.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.960
It's not like you to come in on your day off.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.620
Can you make out the music

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.620
when you listen to all that at once?

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:09.500
Sure, although I'm certainly

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:09.500
no match for Prince Shotoku.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.880
Anyway, Eiko, is there something

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:12.880
you want to see me about?

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.710
Yeah, well...

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:19.380
Lately, we haven't talked at all,

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:23.210
and I was just kind of wondering
what you do on your days off.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.000
Well, let's see...

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.880
Last night, when I viewed the circling of the stars,

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:32.080
the Big Dipper sparkled intensely,

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:37.380
and a multitude of stars painted
an arc from south to east.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.380
According to the divination,

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:44.170
it seems that eastward of Shibuya there will be
a large concentration of qi in Roppongi.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.330
Uh? What does that mean?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.080
Is a meteorite gonna fall or something?

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:52.170
It means tonight the Roppongi area
will be full of excitement,

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.210
so I was thinking of club-hopping there.

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.420
So you just want to party, after all.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.830
How about you join me tonight, Eiko?

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:01.290
Go out and party?

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:04.540
Well, sure, I guess.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.670
Oh? Where's Kongming?

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:10.670
He left with Eiko a bit ago to go party in Roppongi.

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:11.670
What?

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.080
Now he's even taking Eiko along with him?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.500
What the hell's that guy thinking?

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.290
You know...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.500
I don't really know Roppongi that well.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.960
Well then, this evening I shall be your guide.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:28.080
But first, do you mind if I stop by Donki?

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.250
Uh, all right, I'll wait for you!

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:38.080
It's surprisingly hard to tell him straight to his face.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:42.080
Cheers!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:44.000
Wait, this place is definitely NOT full of excitement!

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.080
You mustn't jump to a hasty conclusion.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.120
We're only here for the drinks.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:51.290
It's all you can drink for just 1,000 yen

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.290
during happy hour.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:54.880
It's gentle on my war chest and also
a good chance to listen to trendy music.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:55.960
Ooh...

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:58.120
So, it is possible to drink on the cheap in Roppongi.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.620
Let's use our time here to warm body and mind alike.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:04.170
Hey! Kongming, my man!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:06.960
Seems the two are pretty friendly.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.210
Hi, cutie. You his girl?

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:12.670
No! Kongming is my agent.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:14.670
Ooh, nice!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.790
Or should I say he's my producer?

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.290
Consultant?

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:21.250
But it does just like look like we're having fun.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.710
What is he to me really?

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.670
That hit the spot!

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:35.420
I'm feeling pretty good now.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.330
Yes, I am with you on that.

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.420
Kongming...

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.420
Yes?

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.120
Um, well...

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:44.670
Why do you want a rapper to join up with us?

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.040
When the time comes, you shall understand.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.420
C'mon! That's no fair!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.920
You sound like a phony fortune-teller!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:54.460
Wait, is fortune-telling your actual line of work?

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:56.330
Please call me a tactician.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.710
Come now, let's head to the next place.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.920
This next spot will be tonight's principal theater.

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:02.120
Like a movie theater?

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.750
A theater of war.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.750
Wow! This place is lit!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.290
This is Club V3.

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:13.330
Though it's well known as a pick-up joint,
the DJ's here are highly skilled.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:16.080
And it's a popular spot frequented by people in the biz.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.380
Just look at everyone's outfits...

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:20.380
Yeah.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.750
Decorating oneself ornately to threaten the enemy...

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:29.710
Long ago, the Meng Huo-led war-elephant unit
was also showily decorated.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:34.500
Meng Huo fought against our forces, lost,
and begged forgiveness...

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.830
That course of events played out seven times.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.960
A persistent man, he was.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.750
You done with your story yet?

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:43.380
Forgive me; I couldn't help it.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.960
Forget that, aren't I dressed wrong for this club?

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.000
I thought such a thing might happen.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.210
Huh? What?

00:16:51.460 --> 00:17:02.210
YAY

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.540
I picked these up at Donki earlier!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:57.040
You look sooo lame!

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.670
Let's use some accessories to stand out a bit.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:02.210
You already stand out more than enough!

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.380
Ah! Kongming!

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:05.170
Kongming, buddy! You're here!

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.500
It's been a minute!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.790
Yay!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.620
Seems he's a regular here.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:15.000
Hey, those glasses are actually super cool.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.420
Yeah, slay!

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:17.790
Where'd you buy those?

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.210
We're asking the same thing.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.380
They look great on you!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.250
Those are on point!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.920
Oh, it's DJ Hajimari!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:30.920
Seems he's back in Japan!

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:36.040
Ah, Kongming!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.080
C'mon, wait up, Kongming!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.460
Kongming!

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:42.580
Seriously, what's with him?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.670
Jeez, fine, then!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.500
I'll just go and have fun on my own!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.710
Yay!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.960
TSURUTANTON

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.000
Can't beat udon after a night out partying!

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:57.500
I am glad to hear that.

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:00.500
Anyway, that was rude of you to
just leave me like that.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.540
I don't think this the time for us to be out having fun.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:08.210
I mean, we haven't discussed what we're gonna do
about the "100,000 Likes Project" at all.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:13.580
Back at the club, I was able to obtain some vital intel.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:17.790
It seems I'm finally closing in on
the person I've been searching for.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:23.000
I believe we are one step closer to attaining
success in the "100,000 Likes Project."

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:33.380
That's what you've been doing all of this for?

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.540
You've really been hard at work, huh?

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:38.790
I'm sorry.

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:41.380
It is only natural you were worried.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:44.670
It is true I have been devising a variety of schemes,

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:47.420
but all will be clear to see when the time comes.

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:52.210
I thought it best for you to simply
concentrate on your music.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.120
I believe you.

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:58.250
Eiko, I will say it time and time again.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:03.170
Your singing truly struck a chord with me.

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:07.330
I shall support your dreams with every fiber of my being.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.080
Well, can I make a request, then?

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.420
Anything you wish.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.710
Let's aim for Voicell Land together!

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:18.040
The world's largest EDM festival...

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:23.460
To perform there means to become
a world-class artist.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:25.540
That's my dream.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:28.080
You're the first one I've told it to, Kongming.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:29.790
Eiko...

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.920
Aww, I went and said it!

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:37.250
Even this 100,000 likes thing has me freaking out,
so maybe little ol' me is dreaming too big.

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:38.920
Yes, I see...

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:43.290
First of all, you must stop thinking
of yourself as "little ol' me."

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.420
"Little ol' me"?

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:48.000
Please have more confidence in yourself.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:51.620
Ah, I see, I didn't even realize I was doing that.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.620
I shouldn't say that, should I?

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:58.710
It's not a good idea to fetter yourself with those words.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:04.250
You know, when I was little,
I always used to sing with my dad,

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.670
but one day he was simply gone.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:09.330
But I thought if I just continued with my music,

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.790
I could stay connected to him.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:17.420
But then, my mom became really opposed to my music.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:20.000
I was at a loss for what to do...

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:23.420
I think it's been ever since then that
I've lacked self-confidence.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:29.040
Things went on like for a while, and just when
I no longer gave a crap about anything,

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.420
I met Owner and saw Maria Diesel in concert.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.290
It was then I thought,

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.790
"This is all I've got; I'm going to live for music."

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:42.080
In the end, I just can't let go of my love for music.

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.960
And that's why I want to perform at Voicell Land.

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:48.540
Then, maybe I'll reach them...

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:56.000
Just as a fish needs water,

00:20:56.000 --> 00:21:00.250
I believe you can't live without music, Eiko.

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:03.420
This is called the water-fish fellowship.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.420
Water fish mellow chip?

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:07.250
"Water-fish fellowship."

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:10.920
It means having a friend who is indispensable.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.420
Hmm...

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.670
Then, I guess the two of us are like mellow chips.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.250
Yes?

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.960
It means I'm counting on you.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.420
Understood.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:25.290
The road you seek is not a smooth one.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:31.920
Which is why I appreciate that you revealed
what is in your heart with me today.

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.420
Oh, come on now!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:36.830
The two of us share the same fate.

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:41.380
Please, allow me to stay by your side
until we reach the end of that road.

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:46.790
Say, Kongming...

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.420
What might this be?

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:51.250
I'm not sure if this will help with the 100,000 likes,

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.420
but I made a new song!

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.290
Will you give it a listen?

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:03.540
I did think you were hiding something from me.

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:10.330
Track-10-demo

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.330
Unknown Artist

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:11.040
Track-10-demo

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:11.040
Track-11-ok

00:22:12.170 --> 00:22:14.750
Kurikaesu, every day
Repeating every day

00:22:15.420 --> 00:22:18.500
Naku koto mo wasure
Forgetting even to cry

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:21.580
Iro o ushinatta
Stripped of color

00:22:21.580 --> 00:22:25.120
Yume dake o kakaeteta
Dreams were all you had

00:22:25.880 --> 00:22:29.460
Kizudarake demo, it's all right
Even if you're covered in bruises, it's all right

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:32.380
Kizutsuku koto o kunshou ni
Wearing getting hurt as a medal

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:33.710
<b>Live your life</b>

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:37.330
<b>So you want to be free</b>

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:39.420
Kikoeteru?
Can you hear me?

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:46.540
Tachimukaou mukaikaze
Let's face the headwind

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:50.830
Tsuyoi kurai choudo ii
Being on the strong side is perfect

00:22:50.830 --> 00:22:53.460
<b>Change the world</b>

00:22:53.460 --> 00:22:55.460
<b>Yeah</b>

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:59.210
<b>BEAUTIFUL DREAMER</b>

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:02.670
Kizuite your dream
Preceive your dream

00:23:02.670 --> 00:23:06.250
Dakishimeta negai wa
The wish you held close was

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:09.710
Sora o mezasu
To aim for the sky

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:13.580
<b>BEAUTIFUL DREAMER</b>

00:23:11.380 --> 00:23:16.460
Eiko, this song cheers the heart of those who listen to it.

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:16.790
Nakusu mono wa nai
There is nothing to lose

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:17.460
It's just as if-

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:20.500
Torimodose jibun o
Regain yourself

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:20.750
Jeez! You're gonna make me blush!

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:27.420
Habataku dake kokoro no mama
Just spread your wings as your heart desires

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:22.170
Just keep quiet and listen!

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:25.290
About that "100,000 Likes Project"...

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:27.500
we'll find some way to make the grade.

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:31.080
Umarekawaru
You are reborn

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:29.830
Yeah!

00:23:29.830 --> 00:23:32.380
Sure enough, Roppongi really was

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:35.920
<b>You're like a butterfly</b>

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:34.120
full of excitement tonight.
